  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given reaction is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>(</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math></p><p>The initial concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> minutes.</p><p>Now, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>Δt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>Δt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mi>Δt</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mi>Δt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>Min</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>≃</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>Min</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
